senses.gloss:
√cakṣ (cáṣṭe [628]; cacakṣé; cáṣṭum;
-cákṣya).
 —1. appear;
 —2. look upon,
behold;
 —3. (cause to appear, i. e.) announce,
 tell. [reduplicated form of √kāś,
see 675 and 108g^1 end.]
+ ā,
 —1. look on;
 —2. show, tell, 63^1.
+ vi, appear far and wide, shine.
+ sam, look upon, consider.
